DESCRIPTION:November 22 is Kimchi Day\, and unusually for a food observance
 \, it exists because a national legislature wrote it into a statute. South
  Korea amended its Kimchi Industry Promotion Act in February 2020 to add a
 n article designating the date\, and since 2021 several U.S. state legisla
 tures have adopted the same day by resolution. What none of those document
 s explains is why November 22 in particular.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.co
 m/holiday/national-kimchi-day/
